  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNf00fvN/lios-overhauled-villages.png\" alt=\"莉歐的村莊重構\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">歡迎來到<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>！本模組帶來了全面的改造，為村莊注入了更現代、更活潑的氛圍。體驗升級後的建築、互動元素，以及隱藏在各村莊圖書館中等待被發現的秘密，享受身臨其境的遊戲樂趣。<br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FkZp6Lwt/villages.png\" alt=\"村莊\" width=\"434\" height=\"55\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>平原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>針葉林村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>沙漠村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>熱帶草原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>雪地苔原村莊</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mrsKQ5m4/compatibility.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"645\" height=\"55\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>本模組與大多數其他模組相容，並應能與任何村莊擴充模組搭配運作。不過，如果您需要專門的相容性支援，可以在此處查看！</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-&gt; <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/lios-universal-village-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lio 的村莊相容性資料包</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基於資料包的設定嗎？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        試試看<strong>LioLoader</strong>，實現全域資料包／資源包載入。適用於<strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>的<strong>NeoForge</strong>與<strong>Fabric</strong>。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">前往 Modrinth 開啟 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3pzCfkM/1.png\" alt=\"平原村莊\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/brDfvmC/2.png\" alt=\"平原村莊全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7jY72vN/3.png\" alt=\"平原村莊房屋內部\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zQWZvMn/14.png\" alt=\"針葉林村莊概覽\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1sfBMpg/15.png\" alt=\"針葉林村莊側面視角\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YTqFLmg/7.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/93dX39Q/8.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊側面視角\" width=\"947\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gZdLhQy/9.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊市集\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NKNZ0cn/10.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊地圖學家之屋\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8Nhr8p3/11.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊圖書館\" width=\"945\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PmkSt9x/4.png\" alt=\"熱帶草原村莊\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wwM2nfT/5.png\" alt=\"熱帶草原村莊側面視角\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3RSgdJq/6.png\" alt=\"熱帶草原村莊武器匠視角\" width=\"947\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ChwtS36/12.png\" alt=\"雪地村莊全景\" width=\"948\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/09rZWDW/13.png\" alt=\"雪地村莊全景 版本二\" width=\"950\" height=\"490\" /></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3530fDGj/hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs.png\" alt=\"隱藏秘密與彩蛋\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>圖書館謎題：</strong>探索村莊圖書館，揭開隱藏秘密並發現精心設計的彩蛋。</li>\n<li><strong>互動探索：</strong>與全新的互動元素互動，觸發特殊事件或在找到時獲得寶貴獎勵。</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/seMy8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cvqfFqD/lovbisect.png\" alt=\"lovbisect\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"YouTube 評論\" border=\"0\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\">\n<details>\n<summary>劇透警告</summary>\n<p>-17:25 處評論-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4GQ9mz_q8ko\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>-09:54 處評論-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nFs0BDD85kw\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>-02:52 處評論-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VTaizc8Gsmc\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\"><br /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\" /><br /></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPxQHNKk/usage.png\" alt=\"使用方式\" width=\"692\" height=\"48\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>歡迎自由將<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>用於您選擇的任何 Minecraft 模組整合包。我們鼓勵您將我們的模組加入自訂整合包中，創造多樣且精彩的遊戲體驗。無需尋求明確許可；只需以符合您遊玩風格的方式，盡情享受焕然一新的村莊吧！</p>",
